@NAME@ @VERSION@ — Universal USB Installer (HMG-API & Standalone NEMESIS)
=========================================================================

Unzip this archive onto the top level (root) of a FAT32 or exFAT USB stick so both
"HMGAPI/", "packages/", and "NEMESIS.data" sit at the root of the stick.

Option 1 — Install via HMG-API (recommended when HMG-API is installed):
  1. Plug the USB stick into the car's data USB port.
  2. Open the HMG-API app -> Updates -> Check USB updates.
  3. Install "@NAME@ @VERSION@" and tap Apply changes.

Option 2 — Install via NEMESIS Manager (works WITH or WITHOUT HMG-API):
  1. Plug the USB stick into the car's data USB port.
  2. Open NEMESIS Manager and approve the USB package install prompt
     (or run: nemesis install /storage/usb0/packages/@PACKAGE_ID@.zip).
  3. The installer automatically detects whether HMG-API is installed:
     - With HMG-API: registers the mod in HMG-API with native Gen5W home-screen tile.
     - Without HMG-API: installs standalone on NEMESIS (enables Wi-Fi client with safe
       /system backups, installs the FITCAMX app for Tilepad / 3rd-party launchers, and
       provides OEM backup camera, USB screenshots, and head-unit reboot support).
  4. If this is the first time Wi-Fi client was enabled on the head unit, restart the
     head unit once after installation.

To uninstall from a root shell:
  nemesis uninstall @PACKAGE_ID@
